    "text": "<div>\r<p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span>The length and breadth of a metal sheet are<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>124</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo></math>and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>002</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> respectively. The area of this sheet up to the correct number of significant figures is</span></p>\r</div>\r",
